ch and when i did it was so nice to use. It felt good and not too heavy or light and the buttons respond well. No problems at all\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"comment_id\":326826150,\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Very easy to connect to my phone I played Fortnite on my phone with this fantastic easy set up controller lights make it seem like ur in the zone and it’s smooth. Grip is amazing.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"comment_id\":257553491,\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"This is a really cool controller! Kiddo loves it, especially that it lights up. Husband like that he can change out the buttons too. It was a bit laggy on the first go-round with it, but overall we enjoy the controller, how it functions, how it’s customisable and how it adds another level of fun with the light up feature. Also, I like the charger base, it’s a nice little storage place that’s easy to plug into, unlike the other chargers we have.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":3}]},\"item_details\":{\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\nHall-effect joysticks eliminate drift with 5-million-cycle precision.\\nOne-button toggle switches between PC, Switch, and mobile.\\nMagnetic charging dock powers the controller and stores it.\\nDual asymmetric motors offer three adjustable vibration levels.\\nInterchangeable joysticks and extended buttons for custom fit.\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nThis wireless gaming controller features Hall-effect technology to prevent stick drift and ensure consistent accuracy over millions of cycles. It includes a magnetic charging dock that automatically reconnects when lifted and serves as a storage tool. The device supports 2.4GHz wireless, Bluetooth, and wired USB connections for universal compatibility across PC, Nintendo Switch, iOS, and Android.\\nFunction \\u0026 Performance\\nDual asymmetric motors deliver layered haptic feedback with three adjustable vibration levels. A motion sensor chip enables precise gyroscope mapping for immersive play in PC games. Alloy back buttons and extended buttons provide extra inputs for competitive gaming.\\nMaterials \\u0026 Craftsmanship\\nThe controller features interchangeable joystick height and directional pad components to suit different fighting or racing games. Physical wear is minimized by the durable Hall-effect construction.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"nordstrom-9096735-44444GUMWP\",\"product_id\":120000068607627,\"cspu_id\":\"100000043239434\",\"url\":\"https://www.nordstrom.com/s/wireless-gaming-controller/9096735?origin=category-personalizedsort\\u0026breadcrumb=Home%2FHome\\u0026color=44444GUMWP\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":5999000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Nordstrom\",\"supplier_rating\":4.8,\"website\":\"nordstrom\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-824ht-mput65407wgd11\",\"review_data\":{\"featured_reviews\":[{\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"First of all I’m gonna start by saying how pretty this controller is. It’s such a nice design, very sleek and nice. I had no problems connecting it to the Nintendo switch and when i did it was so nice to use. It felt good and not too heavy or light and the buttons respond well. No problems at all\"},{\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Very easy to connect to my phone I played Fortnite on my phone with this fantastic easy set up controller lights make it seem like ur in the zone and it’s smooth. Grip is amazing.\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"This is a really cool controller! Kiddo loves it, especially that it lights up. Husband like that he can change out the buttons too. It was a bit laggy on the first go-round with it, but overall we enjoy the controller, how it functions, how it’s customisable and how it adds another level of fun with the light up feature. Also, I like the charger base, it’s a nice little storage place that’s easy to plug into, unlik