is hard to open and close, while others note the zipper feels flimsy and undersized on the zipped side.\",\"rating_max\":4.6289},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":334141419,\"user_name\":\"Granny Leah\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"These stars are only for the looks!! I take my first trip with this luggage next weekend. I will let you know!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"create_time\":1792113204},{\"comment_id\":334141421,\"user_name\":\"KAB92\",\"rating\":3,\"content\":\"Just took this on its first trip on an overseas flight.\\nPros: it looks great, it's roomy and the separate compartments are nice to have, and the wheels make it incredibly easy to move with little effort in the airport, on sidewalks, etc.\\nCons: the zippers rotate so that they can be latched in at the top of the case, but that rotation means the zippers twist around while trying to zip and unzip the case so you can't just quickly and smoothly zip/unzip - you have to constantly twist and jerk the zipper around to get it open/closed. Also discovered the case is not waterproof - it was raining at my connection airport so when I got home, the case was still wet (with spotty watermarks after drying that hopefully will clean up) and my clothes inside were slightly damp - luckily it was all dirty clothes as I was coming home, but if it had been the beginning of my work trip and all my work clothes were damp, I would not have been happy.\\n\\nStill debating whether I should return this for something more durable with easier to use zippers.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1791627956},{\"comment_id\":334141418,\"user_name\":\"Deb’s\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I LOVE the color! Purple is my favorite and this one is more beautiful than I thought it would be. Love the updated features - the ability to lock my wheels-wow!! This is the 6th Away suitcase and by far my favorite!!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1791493180},{\"comment_id\":334141420,\"user_name\":\"HalloweenJen\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I love Away luggage! We already have 2 carry-ons and decided that it was time for the next size up. The medium is perfect for long trips- or when you pack light but know you will have things to bring back! ;-) These suitcases have held up through multiple Europe trips and many years. (The red is gorgeous!)\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1791462272},{\"comment_id\":334141422,\"user_name\":\"aka\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"So pretty I\\\"m so excited to use my new Buzz luggage!!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1791256069}]},\"item_details\":{\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\n26-inch Away Medium Checked Luggage in Cherry Red\\nLightweight 100% polycarbonate hard shell\\nPatented dual-buckle compression system\\nFour WhisperGlide 360° spinner wheels\\nInterior organization with 3 mesh pockets and laundry bag\\nTSA-approved combination lock\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nDesigned for 1-2 week trips, this suitcase offers generous packing space with thoughtful functionality and spacious storage.\\nMaterials \\u0026 Craftsmanship\\nConstructed from a lightweight 100% polycarbonate hard shell, the exterior measures 18.5\\\"L x 11\\\"W x 26\\\"H, with an interior capacity of 17.8\\\" x 10.2\\\" x 23.5\\\".\\nFunction \\u0026 Performance\\nThe interior features a dual-buckle compression panel, three mesh pockets, a water-resistant drawstring laundry bag, and a quick-release, 2-position height-adjustable trolley handle.\\nCare Instructions\\nAll suitcases come with Away LifetimeCare Coverage, including repair support for the life of the product for functional damage caused by manufacturing defects or unexpected rough travel.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"dickssportinggoods-24EXLUTHMDMXXXXXXCTP-27789803\",\"product_id\":120000001010903,\"cspu_id\":\"100000061914581\",\"url\":\"https://www.dickssportinggoods.com/p/away-the-medium-checked-suitcase-24exluth