, great weight, and high-quality percale construction. However, some buyers reported poor durability, noting that fitted sheets developed large rips after just two years. Others found the product too large, describing it as excessively wide so it hangs down below the coverlet and covers half the bed skirt.\",\"rating_max\":4.53},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":334324021,\"user_name\":\"Robot\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Met needs perfectly. Fair price, quick delivery. Would buy again.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"create_time\":1792192205},{\"comment_id\":334324023,\"user_name\":\"Skr123\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Obsessed with these sheets. Bummed that it took me 59 years to find these.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1791997059},{\"comment_id\":334324022,\"user_name\":\"Sheets\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"These sheets are amazing. So soft and feel plush without feeling heavy.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1791920187},{\"comment_id\":334324015,\"user_name\":\"Bob27\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I’m always searching for sheets like the percale of the 1950’s-60’s. These are almost there.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1791903776},{\"comment_id\":334324016,\"user_name\":\"CRAK\",\"rating\":3,\"content\":\"I purchased queen size sheets a few weeks ago. I am not completely satisfied, as the top sheet is to long, and the fabric itself is rough. It’s not very soft or comfortable. I definitely won’t be buying these again.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1791895811}]},\"item_details\":{\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Woven from long-staple pima cotton, our premium percale sheet sets have a luxurious, extra-smooth touch for year-round comfort.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"llbean-0RYP8800000RYP880000-XQ302643XQ302643\",\"product_id\":120000063345693,\"cspu_id\":\"100000018017536\",\"url\":\"https://global.llbean.com/llb/shop/113446.html?dwvar_