458eab07539\",\"region\":\"US\",\"agg_level\":4,\"item_id\":0,\"shop_id\":0,\"cspu_id\":\"100000018713803\",\"model_id\":0,\"hero_media\":{\"product_image_id\":[\"https://cf.shopee.sg/file/sg-11134327-823pc-moq8iigw72fha9\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_391a69ef-e844-4518-8484-c431bcff5acd\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_b0d8b468-933f-457e-9f1e-61a0bb01fcb4\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_fa3aaea7-e3a4-46d1-804b-19c61a397301\",\"https://target.scene7.com/is/image/Target/GUEST_4c03ed8f-0638-450c-a65c-b4ae7c713a55\"]},\"summary\":{\"title\":\"DiGiorno Cheese Stuffed Crust Pepperoni Personal Frozen Pizza - 8.5oz\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":419000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"usd\"}},\"variation_infos\":null,\"model_infos\":{\"models\":[{\"offer_id\":\"target-13505878\",\"extinfo\":{}}],\"cur_model_idx\":0},\"review_data\":{\"summary\":{\"total_count\":3262,\"summary_text\":\"83% of customers left positive feedback. Customers particularly appreciate the crispy crust, describing it as perfection, and many agree the pizza is simply delicious. However, a smaller number of reviewers noted that the product lacks flavor overall. Additionally, some customers mentioned the portion size is too small, stating it feels really really small for the price.\",\"rating_max\":4.56},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":335106561,\"user_name\":\"aeh\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I bought the small size, somewhat tempted to eat it all myself, but instead, myself, my husband and my nearly 4 year-old all split it and had it along side of other vegetables. I know if I had bought a whole pizza that we would’ve exclusively eaten pizza and not had a balanced meal with fiber and protein, and all of the things that you need to make sure you feel good a couple of hours afterward. I don’t normally enjoy stuffed crust pizza when I order it from restaurants, but I very much enjoyed it in this little pizza!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"create_time\":1792336001},{\"comment_id\":335106553,\"user_name\":\"CorinneS\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This is the perfect size personal pizza for lunch! It is super easy to cook, I used the toaster oven at work and it was crisp on just 15 minutes. It fulfilled my pizza craving and kept me satiated until dinner. This is a quick and easy lunch and a value at this price point.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1791912271},{\"comment_id\":335106552,\"user_name\":\"CharmaineJ\",\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"I really enjoyed the DiGiorno Personal Stuffed Crust Pepperoni Pizza. The portion size was just right for a personal pizza, and the flavoring was really good. The pepperoni added a nice savory taste, and the crust was soft and tasty. I didn't get the best cheese pull from the stuffed crust, which was a little disappointing 🤣, but the cheese was still delicious. Overall, it was a tasty, satisfying pizza that I would definitely consider getting again.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1791903427},{\"comment_id\":335106551,\"user_name\":\"BrianR\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This DiGiorno Peraonal Pepperoni Stuffed Crust pizza was excellent! I was worried about using the microwave to cook it since I'm at work but it turned out perfect. The portion was perfect as I was full after eating it. I could smell it all the way down the hallway. Lastly, the taste was amazing. I'm a huge fan of DiGiorno and will be purchasing these for work lunches again!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1791826273},{\"comment_id\":335106555,\"user_name\":\"EmmaW\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Really enjoyed the personal pizza. The stuffed crust was delicious and crisped up nicely. It was enough to fill me without feeling like I overate. Packaging was easy to get into and it cook under 20 minutes to cook.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1791763658}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"nam