The food is high quality, and *much more* reasonably priced than either of the big box pet product stores. Definitely will order this again.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1792078849}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Wellness\"},{\"name\":\"Container Size\",\"value\":\"3 oz.\"},{\"name\":\"Container Type\",\"value\":\"Can\"},{\"name\":\"Food Form\",\"value\":\"Wet\"},{\"name\":\"Lifestage\",\"value\":\"Adult\"},{\"name\":\"Quantity\",\"value\":\"24 Can(s)\"},{\"name\":\"Type of Pet\",\"value\":\"Cat\"}],\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\nWellness Good Kitty Wet Cat Food Pate Variety Pack, 3 oz, 24-count\\n9 out of 10 cats love the recipes\\nReal chicken as the first ingredient\\nNo added fillers, carrageenan, artificial colors, flavors, or preservatives\\nDelivers 5 Signs of WellbeingTM + Heart Health\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nThis variety pack includes Chicken Pate and Chicken \\u0026 Cod pate recipes designed to support cat health and wellbeing. The recipes feature protein-rich ingredients with no added fillers, carrageenan, or artificial colors, flavors, or preservatives.\\nMaterials \\u0026 Craftsmanship\\nThe Chicken Recipe contains chicken (source of Glucosamine and Chondroitin Sulfate), chicken broth, chicken liver, chicken hearts, natural flavor, ground brown rice, dried plain beet pulp, guar gum, salmon oil, taurine, dried chicory root, ground flaxseed, potassium chloride, cassia gum, xanthan gum, salt, choline chloride, zinc proteinate, sunflower oil, vitamin E supplement, iron proteinate, L-carnitine, thiamine mononitrate, copper proteinate, manganese proteinate, sodium selenite, niacin supplement, d-calcium pantothenate, pyridoxine hydrochloride, riboflavin supplement, vitamin A supplement, biotin, potassium iodide, vitamin D3 supplement, vitamin B12 supplement, and folic acid. The Chicken \\u0026 Cod Recipe includes cod in addition to the chicken ingredients listed above.\\n