and good fit, noting they can now play baseball comfortably without pain. A smaller number mention the cleats run small, suggesting sizing down 1/2 size from other brands like Nike, while others note the fit is still too narrow despite being wide.\",\"rating_max\":4.759},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":330803629,\"user_name\":\"Rob W\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"My son was having foot pain with other brand cleats but absolutely loves these. Great price\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"create_time\":1790788481},{\"comment_id\":330803630,\"user_name\":\"Sloan24\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"My son loves these cleats. They’re comfortable, look sharp, are light weight and yet durable. We are now New Balance lifers.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1790651136},{\"comment_id\":330803628,\"user_name\":\"Oldtimer softball player\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Comfortable cleats! Went with one size larger, plus wide 2E size. Significant cushion with arch support too.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1790344017},{\"comment_id\":324059226,\"user_name\":\"Debs456\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"These cleats provide a great and comfortable fit for a wide foot.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1790292884},{\"comment_id\":324059227,\"user_name\":\"Ernie C.\",\"rating\":3,\"content\":\"The wide is still narrow needs to be wider had to return. It’s a shame because otherwise they are very comfortable.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1789819799}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"New Balance\"},{\"name\":\"Athletic cleat type\",\"value\":\"Molded Cleats\"},{\"name\":\"Gender\",\"value\":\"Male\"},{\"name\":\"Age group\",\"value\":\"Adult\"},{\"name\":\"Shoe category\",\"value\":\"Men's Shoes\"},{\"name\":\"Model\",\"value\":\"057NB288 RDWH 10H D\"},{\"name\":\"Material\",\"value\":\"TPU\"},{\"name\":\"Shoe sole material\",\"value\":\"Molded\"},{\"name\":\"R